*
!.gitignore

# Map screenshots uploaded via /adm_cod2/maps — tracked on purpose (2026-08-15,
# explicit owner request) so a fresh install elsewhere already has them instead of
# needing every map re-uploaded by hand. Overrides the blanket ignore above, which
# is why this needs both the directory and its contents unignored.
!maps/
!maps/*

# Weapon icons (transparent PNG cutouts, one per weapon code) shown next to each
# weapon's name on /armas — same reasoning as maps/ above, tracked on purpose so a
# fresh install has them without needing to reprocess screenshots.
!weapons/
!weapons/*
